@startuml GridGuard_Sequence_JWT
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title GridGuard — JWT Auth-flöde (plattform → enhet)

participant "GridGuard\nPlatform" as PL
participant "platform.db\n(SQLite)" as PDB
participant "generate_jwt.py" as GEN
participant "GridGuard-client\n(C++)" as CLI
participant "JWTValidator\n(mbedTLS)" as VAL
participant "gridguard.db\n(SQLite)" as GDB

note over PL, GDB : Plattform och enhet kommunicerar ALDRIG direkt.\nDe delar bara GRIDGUARD_JWT_SECRET.

== Engångsinloggning (offline) ==

PL -> PDB : Hämtar userId för användare
PDB --> GEN : userId, email, plan_type
GEN -> GEN : Signerar JWT med GRIDGUARD_JWT_SECRET\nPayload: sub=userId, exp=2030-01-01\nAlgoritm: HS256 (HMAC-SHA256)
GEN --> CLI : JWT-token (header.payload.signature)
CLI -> CLI : Sparar token i\n~/.gridguard/token

== Varje forecast-anrop (online) ==

CLI -> VAL : GET /forecast\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>

VAL -> VAL : 1. Base64url-avkoda header + payload
VAL -> VAL : 2. Beräkna HMAC-SHA256(header.payload, secret)
VAL -> VAL : 3. Jämför med token.signature\n   (constant-time, skyddar mot timing-attack)
VAL -> VAL : 4. Kontrollera exp-fältet mot time(NULL)

alt Ogiltig signatur eller utgången token
    VAL --> CLI : HTTP 401 Unauthorized
else Token giltig
    VAL -> GDB : Slå upp sub (userId)\nHämtar lat/lon/solar/region
    GDB --> VAL : UserConfig
    VAL --> CLI : Kör pipeline → HTTP 200 energiplan
end

@enduml
